        "TileImage": "$($repository ffa68bdd-1e52-4229-9ad3-a0a747eabc70).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, 47. This one&apos;s a bit of a peculiar operation. MI6 has requested the ICA&apos;s aid. Given your track record, they&apos;ve taken an interest in you, and assigned you the &quot;007&quot; status.\r\rCuoco is a corrupt politician positioned as a reformist voice within Sapienza&apos;s local government. We need you to assassinate him with an MI6-provided sniper rifle. Silvia is his security consultant, and also must be taken out.\r\rWe also need you to download data from Silvia&apos;s computer, to identify the group at play.",
